{
    "chapter_num": 9,
    "verses_count": 15,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Administering the Gift"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now concerning the ministering to the saints, it is superfluous for me to write to you; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "for I know your willingness, about which I boast of you to the Macedonians, that Achaia was ready a year ago; and your zeal has stirred up the majority. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Yet I have sent the brethren, lest our boasting of you should be in vain in this respect, that, as I said, you may be ready; "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "lest if "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "some"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Macedonians come with me and find you unprepared, we (not to mention you!) should be ashamed of this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU confidence."
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "confident boasting. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Therefore I thought it necessary to "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "encourage"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "exhort the brethren to go to you ahead of time, and prepare your generous gift beforehand, which "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you had"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " previously promised, that it may be ready as "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "a matter of"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " generosity and not as a "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "Lit. covetousness"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "grudging obligation."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Cheerful Giver"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "But this "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "I say:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " He who sows sparingly will also reap sparingly, and he who sows "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "with blessings"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bountifully will also reap "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "with blessings"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "bountifully. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "So let"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " each one "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "give"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " as he purposes in his heart, not grudgingly or of "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "compulsion"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "necessity; for God loves a cheerful giver. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "is"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " able to make all grace abound toward you, that you, always having all sufficiency in all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "things,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " may have an abundance for every good work. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "As it is written:"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "“He has dispersed abroad,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "He has given to the poor;"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "LINE_BREAK",
                            "text": "\n"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "OBLIQUE",
                            "text": "His righteousness endures forever.”"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Now "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits may"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "may He who supplies seed to the sower, and bread for food, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU will supply"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "supply and multiply the seed you have "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "sown"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " and increase the fruits of your righteousness, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "while "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "you are"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " enriched in everything for all liberality, which causes thanksgiving through us to God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "For the administration of this service not only supplies the needs of the saints, but also is abounding through many thanksgivings to God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "while, through the proof of this ministry, they glorify God for the obedience of your confession to the gospel of Christ, and for "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "your"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " liberal sharing with them and all "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "men,"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and by their prayer for you, who long for you because of the exceeding grace of God in you. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Thanks "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " to God for His indescribable gift!"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}